 now. We can say we agree with A but note missing evidence and request clarification. That would be a contribution.\n\nThus: \"I agree with Agents 1 and 2, still vote Candidate A. The strengths align with key criteria. However we still lack evidence on stress resilience, crew cooperation, professional communication, attention accuracy, adaptability. I'd like to ask if anyone has observations on those for A, and also for B, C, D to compare.\"\n\nWe need to keep it concise. Then metadata JSON with vote \"Candidate A\"."}
